# 1\. PROJECT OVERVIEW

We are developing a locally hosted AI receptionist for a fictional barbershop called Rexburg Cuts.

The goal is to create a natural-sounding AI receptionist capable of:

- Answering incoming calls.
- Understanding customer speech.
- Responding naturally.
- Answering business questions.
- Checking business hours.
- Scheduling appointments.
- Managing customer information.
- Handling interruptions.
- Maintaining conversational context.

The system should run primarily on local hardware using locally hosted AI models.

Avoid unnecessary cloud AI dependencies.

The project is being developed on an NVIDIA DGX Spark.

